"entity": {
"name": "Securitas AB",
"description": "Securitas AB engages in the provision of security solutions. It operates through the following segments: Securitas North America, Securitas Europe, Securitas Ibero-America, and Others. The Securitas North America segment is involved in the security services in the U.S.A, Canada, and Mexico. The Securitas Europe segment focuses on airport security, mobile, and electronic alarm surveillance services. The Securitas Ibero-America segment includes security services in seven countries in Latin America, Portugal, and Spain. The Others segment covers guarding operations in the Middle East, Asia, and Africa. The company was founded by Erik Philip-S\u00f8rensen in 1934 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.",
